## Input

```css
@mixin frames { @if true { 0% { opacity: 0; } } .child { 25% { opacity: 0.25; } } 100% { opacity: 1; } }
.after { 0% { opacity: 0; } }
.sentinel { color: red; }
@if true { 50% { opacity: 0.5; } }
@font-face { @if true { 50% { opacity: 0.5; } } }
@keyframes fade { 0% { @if true { 50% { opacity: 0.5; } } } }
@page { @top-left { @if true { 50% { opacity: 0.5; } } } }
@function --value() { @if true { 50% { opacity: 0.5; } } }

